  "_key": "!scenes!98d3967668684bfa",
  "description": "<p>Where Craft lived before the Hive, and still uses as a private escape when he wants to be human for a while.</p><p><strong>The living area</strong> shows use in the past week: trideo, LiveSound audio, a simsense player and chips that turn out to be mainly Euphoria sims. A crude map of the Amber Gel facility — <strong>including its location</strong> — is here. Empty Amber Gel containers everywhere.</p><p><strong>The bedroom (4) is the source of the stench, and it is a crime scene.</strong> Walls covered in two- and three-dimensional photos and illustrations of Euphoria, many blood-splattered. Judging by the blood, at least one person and probably more have been killed here. Facsimiles of clothing Euphoria wore in her sims, wigs and hairpieces in her styles.</p><p>The bathroom has not been cleaned in months; hundreds of roaches scatter when the lights come on.</p><p><strong>Rooms:</strong> —</p><p><em>Layout derived from the printed floorplan on Queen Euphoria p.40. Measured 17 × 6 m by grid period (41 px, both axes); walls measured off the generated art — the map carries a \"□ = 1 metre\" legend, so the scale is the book's, not an estimate.</em></p>"
}
